            "review_text": "mpbuddy\nSydney, Australia86 contributions\n0\nGreat buffet style vegetarian\nOct 2025 • Couples\nFantastic vegetarian restaurant with a buffet style.Recommended to us whilst undertaking a scooter tour of Hanoi during the daytime ( also great ).\nWonderful selection of fresh vegetarian fare made daily and presented in a buffet style allowing individual choice of dishes.Backed up by selection of sweet treats for after the main meal .Best tofu ever!\nRead more\nWritten October 16, 2025",
