            "review_text": "ellora77\nsingapore137 contributions\n0\nDinner at Veggei castle\nDec 2023 • Family\nDon't judge a book by its cover! The road that leads to this restaurant might put u off! But this is a hidden gem for vegetarians! The food was excellent! They had so many Asian choices, Italian choices, dessert, fruits, fresh juices, soups, rice variety(white and brown), noodles etc. The ambience, decor of the restaurant was nice and calm. The buffet price for one person was SGD$6 . It was just a 3 mnt walk from our accommodation. There is an over bridge road construction going on in the main road, so little difficult to find this restaurant if you are travelling from another area in Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 25, 2023",
