            "review_text": "Paul\nDurham, United Kingdom176 contributions\n0\nwhy such good reviews?\nJul 2023 • Friends\nI'm a meat eater, and I don't mind eating at good veggie places, but I just found it all a bit bland and boring. The soup broth with tomatoes was pretty good, and the sauteed mushrooms was ok too. The rest was just fairly tasteless filler. My vegetarian friend thought it was ok though. \n\nThey dont serve any alcohol at all, apparently because it's run by nuns \n\nThere's no real service, just a bunch of women standing around sternly watching what you do, like they are doing you a favour allowing you to eat there.\n\nI wouldn't eat here again personally.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 12, 2023",
