            "review_text": "Ali_Royal_2015\n879 contributions\n0\nVaried and fresh vegan goodies!\nJul 2023 • Couples\nI’m not usually a big fan of buffets based on how rubbish I usually feel after I’ve inevitably eaten to much. However, my boyfriend was super keen so we have it a try and I really enjoyed it. The buffet isn’t huge, but the food on offer is fresh, varied and they keep it very well stocked up. It’s also a huge plus that everything is vegan so there is no worrying about what you can and can’t have. My favourite part was making up my own Pho bowl, the broth was absolutely delicious. Worthwhile for a treat meal if you are in Hanoi for a few nights.\nRead more\nWritten August 5, 2023",
